Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Blogs|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Blogs|
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	Then Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Blogs Entries
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry1 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry1 Title|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry2 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry2 Title|
	And Blogs add Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry3 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry3 Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry1 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry1 Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry1 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry1 Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry2 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry2 Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry2 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry2 Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry3 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry3 Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry3 Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry3 Title|
