Scenario: Add Custom URL
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And these variables
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
	And these variables
		|entrySubtitle|Blogs Entry Subtitle|
	And these variables
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And BlogsEntry add Entry Content
		|entryContent|${entryContent}|
		|entrySubtitle|${entrySubtitle}|
		|entryTitle|${entryTitle}|
	And Panel expand Panel
		|panelHeading|Configuration|
	And AssertChecked at locator 'Radio#AUTOMATIC_URL'
	And ScrollWebElementIntoView at locator 'Button#PUBLISH'
	And Check at locator 'Radio#CUSTOM_URL'
	And Type the value 'custom-url-here' at locator 'TextInput#BLOGS_ENTRY_URL'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open Specific URL
		|url|${portalURL}/web/guest/blogs-page/-/blogs/custom-url-here|
	Then BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
